    dct:date "2026-10-20"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Credited: 5 dataset files are SHA-256 pinned (`EXPECTED_SHA256`, L118-141) and verified at runtime; the new `peripodial_lumen_reference.json` tags every value `literature` / `derived` / `assumption` / `prediction` and states the residual (`residual_remediation`, L37); `paper_citations.bib` gained McClure & Schubiger 2005 (L38) and Mosaliganti et al. 2019 (L51) and the corrupted `villafombuena2021live` entry (L25) was repaired; the dataset README documents Law 4 and the new file (L34-44). Deductions: the main reference table `wing_disc_dome_folding_reference.json` (timecourse dome 4.2-54.0 um, d_HH 0.8-19.4 um, 7-zone g(s)/curvature, perturbation domes 46.5/51.8/56.4 um, SD 0.142) is not traced to specific figure panels or tables and may be synthesised (-6); the two new DOIs and 10.1242/dev.199728 could not be verified offline (-3); the repaired bib entry still lacks the full author list (-1); the reference curvature 0.0128 um^-1 that `c_finite` is fitted to has no panel citation (-2)." ;
